    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65062,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 371,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>8933/3 Adenosarcoma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 459,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-11 coding",
    "headingPosition": 3,
    "headingid": 372,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65063,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 372,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2C71.Y &amp; XH5544 Other specified malignant neoplasms of vagina &amp; Adenosarcoma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 460,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Related terminology",
    "headingPosition": 4,
    "headingid": 373,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65064,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 373,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Acceptable:</em> M&uuml;llerian adenosarcoma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 461,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 374,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65065,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65066,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Vagina</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65067,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Patients usually present with symptoms of a vaginal mass, including pain, vaginal bleeding, and urinary frequency or incontinence. The mean patient age is 50&nbsp;years (range: 34&ndash;65&nbsp;years).</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65068,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Primary vaginal adenosarcoma is extremely rare, with only 9&nbsp;cases reported in the literature {29402239; 27041653; 15582000}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65069,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65070,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Primary vaginal adenosarcoma may arise in association with endometriosis {29402239; 27041653; 15582000}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65071,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The tumour is usually polypoid and the cut surface solid and cystic. The mean size is 9.3&nbsp;cm (range: 5&ndash;16&nbsp;cm) {29402239; 27041653; 15582000}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65072,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "<p>The morphology of vaginal adenosarcomas is identical to that of their uterine counterparts (see <a style=\"cursor:pointer\" href=\"/chaptercontent/34/321\" target=\"_blank\">section </a><em>Adenosarcoma of the uterine cervix</em>&nbsp;and <a style=\"cursor:pointer\" href=\"/chaptercontent/34/259\" target=\"_blank\">section </a><em>Adenosarcoma of the uterine corpus</em>).</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-10T13:58:17"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65073,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65074,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65075,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> biphasic tumour with benign M&uuml;llerian epithelial and malignant mesenchymal components.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65076,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The staging is the same as for other vaginal malignancies.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65077,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 357,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Approximately two&nbsp;thirds of patients have experienced recurrences. Sarcomatous overgrowth has been reported in 2&nbsp;cases; one patient died of disease {29402239; 27041653; 15582000}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:14:46"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]